title: A pull of a branch that went its own way is refused (fast-forward only): the files are as they were, the local commit stays, and the note says why
folders: git-diverged
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: script: Git\("pull"\)
expect-file: git-diverged/a.txt :: \Aa1\na2\n\z
expect-file: git-diverged/local-only.txt :: ^only here\n
absent-file: git-diverged/from-remote.txt

wait 3500
left changes
wait 1200
mark diverged
wait 450
git pull
wait 3500
mark refused
wait 450
quit
